    <item>
      <title>Redmine 超詳細安裝教學：Redmine 4.1.1 on Ubuntu 16.04</title>
      <link>https://deanlin.net/blog/202102/redmine-installation-ubuntu/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 18 Feb 2021 15:00:45 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://deanlin.net/blog/202102/redmine-installation-ubuntu/</guid>
      <dc:creator>林鼎淵</dc:creator>
      <category>團隊合作</category>
      <description>專案管理的工具非常之多，但是 jira、notion、clickup、trello 這類的專案管理都需要付錢，目前公司採用 Teams 的 planner、Lists 又不符合實際使用情境；之前有短暫的導入 testlink，不過那個 20 年前的 UI…</description>
      <media:content url="https://deanlin.net/blog/202102/redmine-installation-ubuntu/images/redmine-installation-ubuntu-og_hu_de4eae694feaec1.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630" />
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>專案管理的工具非常之多，但是 jira、notion、clickup、trello 這類的專案管理都需要付錢，目前公司採用 Teams 的 planner、Lists 又不符合實際使用情境；之前有短暫的導入 testlink，不過那個 20 年前的 UI 設計很快就勸退大家。基於上述原因決定嘗試使用 Redmine 這個專案管理工具，本篇文章會詳細說明安裝的步驟即遭遇過的問題，文章大綱如下：</p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>一、安裝環境
二、安裝順序
  STEP 1：安裝 MySQL
  STEP 2：建立 Redmine 使用者帳號
  STEP 3：安裝 RVM
  STEP 4：安裝 Ruby
  STEP 5：安裝 Passenger and Nginx
  STEP 6：設定 Nginx
  STEP 7：在 MySQL 增加 redmine 的使用者
  STEP 8：安裝 Redmine
  STEP 9：安裝 Redmine 外掛
  STEP 10：設定 Redmine 寄信功能
三、備註
</code></pre><p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202102/redmine-installation-ubuntu/images/redmine-installation-ubuntu-01.webp" width="1400" height="784" alt="Redmine 超詳細安裝教學：Redmine 4.1.1 on Ubuntu 16.04（圖 1）" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></p>
<h2 id="一安裝環境">一、安裝環境<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e4%b8%80%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%9d%e7%92%b0%e5%a2%83" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>官方沒有建議的硬體規格，但是看到有 <a href="https://www.redmineup.com/pages/blog/self-hosted-on-in-the-cloud-how-to-choose-infrastructure-and-hardware-configuration-for-redmine">文章分享</a> 最低硬體配置如下：</p>
<ul>
<li>Processor: Intel Celeron (min 300 MHz)</li>
<li>RAM: 1–2 GB RAM</li>
<li>HDD: 30–40 GB</li>
</ul>
<p>但通常使用最低硬體配置得到的結果就是容易卡，很多人同時上線使用時會讓卡到讓你懷疑人生，下面是我安裝時的配置目前使用起來算是流暢給大家參考用：</p>
<ul>
<li>Processor: 使用 VMWARE 的虛擬單核心</li>
<li>RAM: 8GB RAM</li>
<li>HDD: 500 GB</li>
<li>OS: ubuntu 16.04</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="二安裝順序">二、安裝順序<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e4%ba%8c%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%9d%e9%a0%86%e5%ba%8f" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<blockquote>
<p>操作時請注意角色權限(root、redmine)，否則安裝到一半會卡住</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 id="step-1安裝-mysql">STEP 1：安裝 MySQL<a class="h-anchor" href="#step-1%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%9d-mysql" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<blockquote>
<p>角色： root</p>
</blockquote>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">1.</span> 安裝 MySQL 套件
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    ``<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    apt install build-essential mysql-server libmysqlclient-dev imagemagick libmagickwand-dev
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">2. 安裝後驗證 MySQL Version
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    mysql -u root -p
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>``
</span></span></code></pre></div><p class="code-source">原始碼：<a href="https://gist.github.com/dean9703111/b38188a5ef4141b93c01b319a80b371b" rel="noopener">mysql_install.md</a>（GitHub Gist）</p>
<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202102/redmine-installation-ubuntu/images/redmine-installation-ubuntu-02.webp" width="1258" height="514" alt="看到類似上方的 MySQL 資訊就代表你安裝成功嚕！" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>看到類似上方的 MySQL 資訊就代表你安裝成功嚕！</figcaption>
</figure>

<h2 id="step-2建立-redmine-使用者帳號">STEP 2：建立 Redmine 使用者帳號<a class="h-anchor" href="#step-2%e5%bb%ba%e7%ab%8b-redmine-%e4%bd%bf%e7%94%a8%e8%80%85%e5%b8%b3%e8%99%9f" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<blockquote>
<p>角色： root</p>
</blockquote>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">1.</span> 建立 Redmine 使用者，資料放在 <span style="color:#a5d6ff">`/data/redmine`</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    ``<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    adduser --system \
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">        --shell /bin/bash \
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">        --gecos &#39;Redmine Administrator&#39; \
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">        --group \
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">        --home /data/redmine redmine;
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">2. 建立 rvm group
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    groupadd rvm
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">3. 允許 redmine 可以 sudo
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    adduser redmine sudo
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">4. 設定 redmine 密碼
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    passwd redmine
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">5. 將 redmine 使用者加入 rvm 群組
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    usermod -a -G rvm redmine
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>``
</span></span></code></pre></div><p class="code-source">原始碼：<a href="https://gist.github.com/dean9703111/7443c1b56e1f7a585472834ea2ec65b0" rel="noopener">add_redmine_user.md</a>（GitHub Gist）</p>
<h2 id="step-3安裝-rvm">STEP 3：安裝 RVM<a class="h-anchor" href="#step-3%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%9d-rvm" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<blockquote>
<p>角色： redmine</p>
</blockquote>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">1.</span> 安裝gnupg2
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    ``<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    sudo apt install gnupg2
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">2. 安裝 GPG keys:
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    gpg2 --recv-keys 409B6B1796C275462A1703113804BB82D39DC0E3 7D2BAF1CF37B13E2069D6956105BD0E739499BDB
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">3. 安裝 RVM
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    \curl -sSL https://get.rvm.io | bash -s stable
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">4. 讓 rvm 指令生效
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    source /data/redmine/.rvm/scripts/rvm
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">5. 確認安裝的RVM版本
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    rvm --version
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>``
</span></span></code></pre></div><p class="code-source">原始碼：<a href="https://gist.github.com/dean9703111/c05ee64e18057de7a430df6b474ebd9e" rel="noopener">install_RVM.md</a>（GitHub Gist）</p>
<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202102/redmine-installation-ubuntu/images/redmine-installation-ubuntu-03.webp" width="1400" height="74" alt="看到類似上方的 RVM 資訊就代表你安裝成功嚕！" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>看到類似上方的 RVM 資訊就代表你安裝成功嚕！</figcaption>
</figure>

<h2 id="step-4安裝-ruby">STEP 4：安裝 Ruby<a class="h-anchor" href="#step-4%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%9d-ruby" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<blockquote>
<p>角色： redmine</p>
</blockquote>
<p>作者的 <strong>RUBY_VERSION 為 2.3.8</strong>，這裡安裝的版本請<a href="https://www.redmine.org/projects/redmine/wiki/redmineinstall#Ruby-interpreter">參考 Redmine 的官方建議</a>，如果安裝其他的版本後續安裝 Redmine 時會發生錯誤</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">1.</span> 檢查 rvm 必要的套件
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    ``<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    rvm requirements
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">2. 安裝指定的 ruby version
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    rvm install ${RUBY_VERSION}
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">3. 將此版本設定為預設
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    rvm use ${RUBY_VERSION} --default
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">4. 確認安裝的 Ruby 版本
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    ruby --version
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>``
</span></span></code></pre></div><p class="code-source">原始碼：<a href="https://gist.github.com/dean9703111/26719eedd99c32afc8f8d5820e058078" rel="noopener">intsall_ruby.md</a>（GitHub Gist）</p>
<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202102/redmine-installation-ubuntu/images/redmine-installation-ubuntu-04.webp" width="1400" height="74" alt="看到類似上方的 ruby 資訊就代表你安裝成功嚕！" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>看到類似上方的 ruby 資訊就代表你安裝成功嚕！</figcaption>
</figure>

<h2 id="step-5安裝-passenger-and-nginx">STEP 5：安裝 Passenger and Nginx<a class="h-anchor" href="#step-5%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%9d-passenger-and-nginx" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<blockquote>
<p>角色： root</p>
</blockquote>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">1.</span> 安裝 Passenger PGP key 和 HTTPS support for package manager
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    ``<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    apt install -y dirmngr gnupg
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    apt-key adv --keyserver hkp://keyserver.ubuntu.com:80 --recv-keys 561F9B9CAC40B2F7 
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    apt install -y apt-transport-https ca-certificates
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">2. Add passenger APT repository
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    sh -c &#39;echo deb https://oss-binaries.phusionpassenger.com/apt/passenger xenial main &gt; /etc/apt/sources.list.d/passenger.list&#39;
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    apt update
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">3. 安裝 Passenger and NGINX
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    apt install -y nginx-extras passenger
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>``
</span></span></code></pre></div><p class="code-source">原始碼：<a href="https://gist.github.com/dean9703111/b44c3fa2e4c3a95b133182431af9da3c" rel="noopener">install_Passenger_Nginx.md</a>（GitHub Gist）</p>
<h2 id="step-6設定-nginx">STEP 6：設定 Nginx<a class="h-anchor" href="#step-6%e8%a8%ad%e5%ae%9a-nginx" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<blockquote>
<p>角色： root</p>
</blockquote>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">1.</span> 編輯 Nginx 設定檔案
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    ``<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    vi /etc/nginx/nginx.conf
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">2. 移除此行註解#：`</span>include /etc/nginx/passenger.conf;<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`conf
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    ...
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    ##
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    # Phusion Passenger config
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    ##
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    # Uncomment it if you installed passenger or passenger-enterprise
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    ##
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    include /etc/nginx/passenger.conf;
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">3. 接下來要調整 Nginx 的網站設定，所以建議先備份原本的設定
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    cp /etc/nginx/sites-available/default /etc/nginx/sites-available/default.orig
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">5. 編輯 Nginx 的網站設定
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    vi /etc/nginx/sites-available/default
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">6. 調整網站的根目錄位置以及 Passenger 設定
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    #root /var/www/html; #將原本的註解或是移除
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    root /data/redmine/current/public;
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    passenger_enabled on;
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    client_max_body_size 10m;
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">7. 把 location 段落註解
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    #location / {
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">            # First attempt to serve request as file, then
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">            # as directory, then fall back to displaying a 404.
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    #       try_files $uri $uri/ =404;
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    #}
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>``
</span></span></code></pre></div><p class="code-source">原始碼：<a href="https://gist.github.com/dean9703111/dc2d42e3059a7beff2912bbd34be52ea" rel="noopener">set_nginx.md</a>（GitHub Gist）</p>
<p>完成上述步驟後再做以下驗證：</p>
<ol>
<li>更改目錄權限： <code>chown -R www-data /var/www</code></li>
<li>重啟 Nginx： <code>systemctl restart nginx</code></li>
<li>驗證 Passenger and NGINX: <code>/usr/bin/passenger-config validate-install</code></li>
</ol>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202102/redmine-installation-ubuntu/images/redmine-installation-ubuntu-05.webp" width="1030" height="426" alt="STEP 6：設定 Nginx（圖 5）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>4. 檢查 Ngninx 狀態與 Passenger process: <code>/usr/sbin/passenger-memory-stats</code></p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202102/redmine-installation-ubuntu/images/redmine-installation-ubuntu-06.webp" width="1400" height="498" alt="STEP 6：設定 Nginx（圖 6）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<h2 id="step-7在-mysql-增加-redmine-的使用者">STEP 7：在 MySQL 增加 redmine 的使用者<a class="h-anchor" href="#step-7%e5%9c%a8-mysql-%e5%a2%9e%e5%8a%a0-redmine-%e7%9a%84%e4%bd%bf%e7%94%a8%e8%80%85" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<blockquote>
<p>角色： root</p>
</blockquote>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">1.</span> 登入 MySQL
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    ``<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    mysql -u root -p
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">3. 創建 redmine 資料庫
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    CREATE DATABASE redmine CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci;
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">4. 創建 redmine 使用者，密碼記得自行調整
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    CREATE USER &#39;redmine&#39;@&#39;localhost&#39; IDENTIFIED BY &#39;password&#39;;
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">5. 給予使用者權限
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON redmine.* TO &#39;redmine&#39;@&#39;localhost&#39;;
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">6. 使權限生效
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    FLUSH PRIVILEGES;
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">7. 離開 MySQL
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    quit;
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>``
</span></span></code></pre></div><p class="code-source">原始碼：<a href="https://gist.github.com/dean9703111/f0d6fa77b683a40cec8d44e5be51e36c" rel="noopener">mysql_add_redmine_user.md</a>（GitHub Gist）</p>
<h2 id="step-8安裝-redmine">STEP 8：安裝 Redmine<a class="h-anchor" href="#step-8%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%9d-redmine" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<blockquote>
<p>角色： redmine</p>
</blockquote>
<h3 id="-下載官方-image">下載官方 image<a class="h-anchor" href="#-%e4%b8%8b%e8%bc%89%e5%ae%98%e6%96%b9-image" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h3>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">1.</span> 到[<span style="color:#7ee787">官方網站</span>](https://www.redmine.org/projects/redmine/wiki/Download)了解最新的stable版本（筆者安裝版本為 4.1.1）
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">2.</span> 前往放置 redmine image 的目錄
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    ``<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    cd /data/redmine
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">3. 下載官方 image 並解壓縮
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    wget https://www.redmine.org/releases/redmine-4.1.1.tar.gz
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    tar zxvf redmine-4.1.1.tar.gz
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">4. 建立連結資料夾 current
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    ln -s redmine-4.1.1 current
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">5. 前往連結資料夾
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    cd current
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>``
</span></span></code></pre></div><p class="code-source">原始碼：<a href="https://gist.github.com/dean9703111/523ff799ed15fd78787e5664bcd589e3" rel="noopener">redmine_download.md</a>（GitHub Gist）</p>
<h3 id="-調整-redmine-裡面的資料庫設定">調整 redmine 裡面的資料庫設定<a class="h-anchor" href="#-%e8%aa%bf%e6%95%b4-redmine-%e8%a3%a1%e9%9d%a2%e7%9a%84%e8%b3%87%e6%96%99%e5%ba%ab%e8%a8%ad%e5%ae%9a" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h3>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">1.</span> 將 redmine 的資料庫範例設定檔複製一份
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    ``<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    cp -pR config/database.yml.example config/database.yml
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">2. 編輯資料庫設定檔案
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    vi config/database.yml
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`  
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">3.  調整 production 的資訊即可，內容填上 STEP7 建立的使用者資訊即可
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`yml
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    production:
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">      adapter: mysql2
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">      database: redmine
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">      host: localhost
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">      username: redmine
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">      password: &#34;your password&#34;
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">      # Use &#34;utf8&#34; instead of &#34;utfmb4&#34; for MySQL prior to 5.7.7
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">      encoding: utf8mb4
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>``
</span></span></code></pre></div><p class="code-source">原始碼：<a href="https://gist.github.com/dean9703111/9cb24f48fd8b8fa969c4138a12186a76" rel="noopener">redmine_database_config.md</a>（GitHub Gist）</p>
<h3 id="-下載相關套件">下載相關套件<a class="h-anchor" href="#-%e4%b8%8b%e8%bc%89%e7%9b%b8%e9%97%9c%e5%a5%97%e4%bb%b6" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h3>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">1.</span> 先確認當前資料夾為 <span style="color:#a5d6ff">`/data/redmine/current`</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    ``<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    pwd
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">2. 執行 gem, bundle 安裝依賴套件
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    gem install bundler
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    bundle install --without development test
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    &gt; 如果安裝過程中遇到錯誤可能是因為沒有安裝到 ruby 的套件  
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    &gt; 1. 先安裝 `</span>sudo apt-get install ruby-dev<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`  
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    &gt; 2. 再執行一次 `</span>bundle install --without development test` 確認有無報錯
</span></span></code></pre></div><p class="code-source">原始碼：<a href="https://gist.github.com/dean9703111/540d8de42ff10326664acdb6f29c08d4" rel="noopener">redmine_install_package.md</a>（GitHub Gist）</p>
<h3 id="-初始化-redmine">初始化 redmine<a class="h-anchor" href="#-%e5%88%9d%e5%a7%8b%e5%8c%96-redmine" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h3>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">1.</span> 先確認當前資料夾為 /data/redmine/current
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    ``<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    pwd
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">2. 用 Rake 啟動 redmine
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    bundle exec rake generate_secret_token
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">3. Migrate Database Schema(初始化資料庫)
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    RAILS_ENV=production bundle exec rake db:migrate
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">4. Load Initial Data(下面會請你選擇語言，預設為英文，語言後續都能再做調整)
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    RAILS_ENV=production bundle exec rake redmine:load_default_data
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">5. 用 Nginx 重啟 Redmine
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    sudo systemctl restart nginx
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>``
</span></span></code></pre></div><p class="code-source">原始碼：<a href="https://gist.github.com/dean9703111/79b903f7c4f1f22821aa91bbb21dca06" rel="noopener">redmine_init.md</a>（GitHub Gist）</p>
<p>接下來你可以瀏覽 <code>http:&lt;server_ip&gt;</code> ，如果順利的話可以看到 Redmine 登入畫面如下：</p>
<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202102/redmine-installation-ubuntu/images/redmine-installation-ubuntu-07.webp" width="1148" height="565" alt="預設 admin/admin 登入" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>預設 <code>admin/admin</code> 登入</figcaption>
</figure>

<h2 id="step-9安裝-redmine-外掛">STEP 9：安裝 Redmine 外掛<a class="h-anchor" href="#step-9%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%9d-redmine-%e5%a4%96%e6%8e%9b" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<blockquote>
<p>角色： redmine</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Plugin 安裝方式雷同，下面以 <code>Redmine Dashboard 2</code>為範例安裝</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">1.</span> 先進入 redmine 的 plugin 資料夾
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    ``<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    cd /current/plugins
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">2. 下載 plugin，最新的 release 請參考[官方](https://github.com/jgraichen/redmine_dashboard)
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    wget https://github.com/jgraichen/redmine_dashboard/archive/v2.9.0.tar.gz
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">3. 解壓縮檔案
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    tar zxvf v2.9.0.tar.gz
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">4. 移除壓縮檔
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    rm v2.9.0.tar.gz
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">6.  安裝相關套件
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    bundle install
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">7. 將套件相關 DB 進行 migrate 到 production
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    rake db:migrate RAILS_ENV=production
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">8. 將套件安裝至 production
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    bundle exec rake redmine:plugins:migrate RAILS_ENV=production
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">9. 安裝完畢後重啟讓設定生效
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    sudo systemctl restart nginx
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>``
</span></span></code></pre></div><p class="code-source">原始碼：<a href="https://gist.github.com/dean9703111/d625c9f43d9667e086f3eb73328becb6" rel="noopener">redmine_plugin.md</a>（GitHub Gist）</p>
<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202102/redmine-installation-ubuntu/images/redmine-installation-ubuntu-08.webp" width="1148" height="529" alt="安裝成功後的外掛程式會直接出現喔～" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>安裝成功後的外掛程式會直接出現喔～</figcaption>
</figure>

<h2 id="step-10設定-redmine-寄信功能">STEP 10：設定 Redmine 寄信功能<a class="h-anchor" href="#step-10%e8%a8%ad%e5%ae%9a-redmine-%e5%af%84%e4%bf%a1%e5%8a%9f%e8%83%bd" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<blockquote>
<p>角色： redmine</p>
</blockquote>
<p>如果沒做這個步驟是寄不出信的，需要做下面的調整即可</p>
<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202102/redmine-installation-ubuntu/images/redmine-installation-ubuntu-09.webp" width="1400" height="125" alt="設定前在：網站管理&gt;設定&gt;電子郵件提醒選項。會出現的畫面" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>設定前在：網站管理&gt;設定&gt;電子郵件提醒選項。會出現的畫面</figcaption>
</figure>

<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#e6edf3;background-color:#0d1117;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"><code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#ff7b72">1.</span> 進入 redmine 設定的資料夾
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    ``<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    cd /current/config
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">2. 將 redmine 的設定範例設定檔複製一份
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    cp -pR configuration.yml.example configuration.yml
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">3. 編輯 redmine 設定檔案
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    vi configuration.yml
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">4. 調整 production 的資訊即可，下面用 Gmail 作為範例
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    production:
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">      delivery_method: :smtp
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">      smtp_settings:
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">        enable_starttls_auto: true
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">        address: &#34;smtp.gmail.com&#34;
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">        port: 587
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">        domain: &#34;smtp.gmail.com&#34; # &#39;your.domain.com&#39; for GoogleApps
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">        authentication: :plain
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">        user_name: &#34;email&#34;
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">        password: &#34;email pw&#34;
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">     `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">5. 設定完畢後重啟生效
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>`<span style="color:#a5d6ff">`
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    sudo systemctl restart nginx
</span></span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#a5d6ff">    `</span>``
</span></span></code></pre></div><p class="code-source">原始碼：<a href="https://gist.github.com/dean9703111/120f7f2368b770899f5cacdc8344e61a" rel="noopener">redmine_email.md</a>（GitHub Gist）</p>
<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202102/redmine-installation-ubuntu/images/redmine-installation-ubuntu-10.webp" width="1147" height="488" alt="網站管理&gt;設定&gt;電子郵件提醒選項的右下角會有“寄送測試郵件的按鈕”提供測試喔" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>網站管理&gt;設定&gt;電子郵件提醒選項的右下角會有“寄送測試郵件的按鈕”提供測試喔</figcaption>
</figure>

<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202102/redmine-installation-ubuntu/images/redmine-installation-ubuntu-11.webp" width="1262" height="484" alt="收到的測試郵件會長這個樣子" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
  <figcaption>收到的測試郵件會長這個樣子</figcaption>
</figure>

<h2 id="三備註">三、備註<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e4%b8%89%e5%82%99%e8%a8%bb" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<ol>
<li>如果進入網頁時畫面沒有顯示應該是因為防火牆問題，可以用下面指令嘗試：<code>sudo ufw allow http</code> 、<code>sudo ufw allow https</code></li>
<li>參考資源：<a href="https://rickhw.github.io/2019/05/11/Redmine/Install-Redmine40x-on-Ubuntu1604/">Redmine 安裝篇：Redmine 4.0.x on Ubuntu 16.04</a>、<a href="https://rickhw.github.io/2017/03/18/Redmine/Redmine-Plugins/">Redmine Plugins and Themes</a>、<a href="https://www.redmine.org/projects/redmine/wiki/HowTo_Install_Redmine_on_Ubuntu_step_by_step">HowTo Install Redmine on Ubuntu step by step</a></li>
</ol>
